{"4254920": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Possessed Kingdom", "steam_appid": 4254920, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254920/extras/401ed8d20b93b129631f70dbf471b332.avif?t=1786379817\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254920/extras_big/401ed8d20b93b129631f70dbf471b332.webp?t=1786379817 width=1560 height=211 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254920/extras/fcdd99130983ef4efe98a5c01d60442b.poster.avif?t=1786379817\" width=1170 height=652 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254920/extras/fcdd99130983ef4efe98a5c01d60442b.webm?t=1786379817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254920/extras/fcdd99130983ef4efe98a5c01d60442b.mp4?t=1786379817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No more units getting stuck on walls. <strong>You</strong> control the exact route.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bypass Defenses:</strong> Draw a line to sneak past tanky towers and hit their weak economy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Flanking:</strong> Split your forces by drawing two pincer movements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Timing Pushes:</strong> Funnel your army into a single death ball to break their line.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254920/extras/d1ec573b84142ccea7548818b93f32bb.avif?t=1786379817\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254920/extras_big/d1ec573b84142ccea7548818b93f32bb.webp?t=1786379817 width=1560 height=211 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254920/extras/06eb17ba68d9a8c1b67e84f38560e58f.poster.avif?t=1786379817\" width=1170 height=652 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254920/extras/06eb17ba68d9a8c1b67e84f38560e58f.webm?t=1786379817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254920/extras/06eb17ba68d9a8c1b67e84f38560e58f.mp4?t=1786379817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Economy:</strong> Play cards to generate gold per round.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Raise an Army:</strong> Construct Barracks to train troops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Siege the Enemy:</strong> Create a physical path for your troops to bypass defenses and destroy the enemy base.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loot the Deck:</strong> Upon victory, steal 3 cards from the enemy's deck to power up for the next battle.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254920/extras/caca289521129c3968d79c5951bfd702.avif?t=1786379817\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254920/extras_big/caca289521129c3968d79c5951bfd702.webp?t=1786379817 width=1560 height=211 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254920/extras/7edcc61b25c2cd3344ebb4064838a450.poster.avif?t=1786379817\" width=1170 height=652 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254920/extras/7edcc61b25c2cd3344ebb4064838a450.webm?t=1786379817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254920/extras/7edcc61b25c2cd3344ebb4064838a450.mp4?t=1786379817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeating an enemy isn't just a win; it's a robbery.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loot the Deck:</strong> Upon victory, <strong>steal cards</strong> from the enemy to power up your own deck.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deck Size Management:</strong> You have limited deck space. Do you steal powerful cards for immediate power, or buy more Deck Size to scale for the late game?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Counter-Pick:</strong> Read the enemy playstyle (Aggressive, Economic, Defensive) before the battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reroll:</strong> Don't like the enemy match-up? <strong>Reroll</strong> their playstyle to find an opening—but choose wisely. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254920/extras/3b0cdce23fd47db797ee5eda2e6f9ada.avif?t=1786379817\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254920/extras_big/3b0cdce23fd47db797ee5eda2e6f9ada.webp?t=1786379817 width=1560 height=176 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254920/extras/f2cb2f45d31b0d9f4a5d71b47b61f1c3.poster.avif?t=1786379817\" width=1170 height=652 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c